    "summary": "With mixed visibility or positions in area terrain, check **[Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)** for the defending unit from each shooter’s position. Some shooters may face cover while others do not. In **[Resolve Attacks](vsdata:core-rule/resolve-attacks)**, if the shooters use the same weapon, gather dice in separate batches for those two cover outcomes.",
